---
description: Somali language rules for all Somali text
alwaysApply: true
---

For all Somali text in this project (UI strings, copy, comments, docs), follow
@m2b-somali/GLOSSARY.md exactly.

- Use the ✅ Correct Somali word for every term listed there.
- Never use a word from the ❌ Wrong column.
- Follow the glossary's style rules (Somaliland spelling, short button labels, tone).
- Reuse keys and wording from m2b-somali/strings/so.json where they fit.
